  "summary": "An aesthetic inspired by elven cultures in fantasy fiction, emphasizing ethereal beauty, nature harmony, and elegant craftsmanship.",
  "description": "The Elven aesthetic draws from elven cultures in fantasy fiction, particularly Tolkien's legendarium and its descendants. It emphasizes ethereal beauty, harmony with nature, elegant craftsmanship, flowing organic forms, and a sense of ancient wisdom. Visual elements include pointed ears, flowing robes, silver and gold jewelry, forest settings, and graceful architecture that blends with natural surroundings.",
